  "title": "Word order: verb second",
  "titleAf": "Woordorde",
  "icon": "🔀",
  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "u08-1",
      "title": "The verb is always second",
      "explanation": [
        "In a normal sentence the verb is the **second** item.",
        "**Ek gaan vandag skool toe.** If you start with *vandag*, the verb still comes second, so *ek* moves after it: **Vandag gaan ek skool toe.**",
        "❌ *Vandag ek gaan skool toe.* ✅ **Vandag gaan ek skool toe.**",
        "**gaan** = go. Going **to** a place: put **toe** after the place: **skool toe** (to school), **strand toe** (to the beach), **huis toe** (home)."
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
          "af": "Ek gaan vandag skool toe.",
          "en": "I'm going to school today."
        },
        {
          "af": "Vandag gaan ek skool toe.",
          "en": "Today I'm going to school."
        },
        {
          "af": "Môre gaan ons strand toe.",
          "en": "Tomorrow we're going to the beach."
        },
        {
          "af": "Ek gaan huis toe.",
          "en": "I'm going home."
        }
      ],
      "vocab": [
        "gaan",
        "skool",
        "toe",
        "strand"
      ],
      "exercises": [
        {
          "type": "order",
          "en": "Today I'm going to school.",
          "af": "Vandag gaan ek skool toe."
        },
        {
          "type": "order",
          "en": "Tomorrow we're going to the beach.",
          "af": "Môre gaan ons strand toe."
        },
        {
          "type": "choice",
          "question": "Which sentence is correct?",
          "options": [
            "Vandag werk ek.",
            "Vandag ek werk.",
            "Werk vandag ek."
          ],
          "answer": "Vandag werk ek."
        },
        {
          "type": "transform",
          "instruction": "Start the sentence with **Môre**",
          "from": "Ek gaan môre skool toe.",
          "answers": [
            "Môre gaan ek skool toe."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "translate",
          "from": "en",
          "prompt": "I'm going home.",
          "answers": [
            "Ek gaan huis toe."
          ]
        },
